---
import { radialFunctionProfile, usefulRelationsDefaults } from '../../../data/part07/usefulRelationsModel.mjs';

const defaults = radialFunctionProfile({ l: usefulRelationsDefaults.radial.l, xMin: 0.65, xMax: 12 });
const width = 760;
const height = 350;
const left = 62;
const right = 700;
const top = 42;
const bottom = 270;
const displayLimit = 2.5;
const xMap = (x) => left + (right - left) * (x - 0.65) / (12 - 0.65);
const yMap = (value) => (top + bottom) / 2 - Math.max(-displayLimit, Math.min(displayLimit, value)) * (bottom - top) * 0.42 / displayLimit;
const pathFor = (key) => defaults.samples.map((entry, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xMap(entry.x).toFixed(2)} ${yMap(entry[key]).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
const fallback = [0, 1, 2, 3].map((l) => radialFunctionProfile({ l, xMin: 0.65, xMax: 12 }));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual radial-functions" data-k-radial>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：球 Bessel、Neumann 与 Hankel 径向结构</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: spherical Bessel, Neumann, and Hankel radial structure</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls radial-functions__controls">
    <label>
      <span>l | 角动量阶数</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="6" step="1" value={usefulRelationsDefaults.radial.l} data-k-radial-l />
      <output data-k-radial-l-output>{usefulRelationsDefaults.radial.l}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>xmax | 显示区间</span>
      <input type="range" min="6" max="18" step="1" value="12" data-k-radial-xmax />
      <output data-k-radial-xmax-output>12</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby="k-radial-title k-radial-desc">
    <title id="k-radial-title">Spherical Bessel and Neumann functions on a positive real interval</title>
    <desc id="k-radial-desc">The regular Bessel function remains finite at the origin while the Neumann function is singular. The displayed curves are clipped vertically for readability.</desc>
    <line x1={left} y1={(top + bottom) / 2} x2={right} y2={(top + bottom) / 2} class="plot-guide" />
    <line x1={left} y1={bottom} x2={right} y2={bottom} class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1={left} y1={top} x2={left} y2={bottom} class="plot-axis" />
    <path d={pathFor('j')} class="plot-curve" data-k-radial-j />
    <path d={pathFor('n')} class="radial-functions__n" data-k-radial-n />
    <text x={right} y="302" text-anchor="end">x</text>
    <text x="16" y="52">value</text>
    <text x={right - 100} y="58">j_l(x)</text>
    <text x={right - 100} y="80" class="radial-functions__n-label">n_l(x)</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout radial-functions__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>l</span><strong data-k-radial-l-readout>{defaults.l}</strong>
    <span>j_l(0.65)</span><strong data-k-radial-origin>{defaults.samples[0].j.toExponential(4)}</strong>
    <span>Wronskian(mid)</span><strong data-k-radial-wronskian>{defaults.wronskianAtMidpoint.toExponential(5)}</strong>
    <span>expected 1/x²</span><strong data-k-radial-expected>{(1 / ((0.65 + 12) / 2) ** 2).toExponential(5)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="radial-functions__fallback">
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript 参考表 | No-JavaScript reference table</strong></p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>l</th><th>j_l(0.65)</th><th>n_l(0.65)</th><th>Wronskian(mid)</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>{fallback.map((entry) => <tr><td>{entry.l}</td><td>{entry.samples[0].j.toExponential(3)}</td><td>{entry.samples[0].n.toExponential(3)}</td><td>{entry.wronskianAtMidpoint.toExponential(3)}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>K.1–K.3 的实轴球 Bessel/Neumann 函数；<code>h_l^(1)=j_l+i n_l</code>。高 <code>l</code>、小 <code>x</code> 的 <code>j_l</code> 使用幂级数，避免不稳定向上递推。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> real-axis spherical Bessel and Neumann functions from K.1–K.3, with <code>h_l^(1)=j_l+i n_l</code>. A power series replaces unstable upward recurrence for high <code>l</code> and small <code>x</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>j_l(x)~x^l/(2l+1)!!</code>；<code>n_l</code> 在原点奇异；良态区满足 <code>j_l n_l'−j_l'n_l=1/x²</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> <code>j_l(x)~x^l/(2l+1)!!</code>, <code>n_l</code> is singular at the origin, and the conditioned Wronskian is <code>1/x²</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>图中纵轴为可读性裁剪。虚参数束缚态应使用明确的解析延拓或 modified spherical functions，不能把实轴图直接外推。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the plotted vertical range is clipped. Imaginary-argument bound states require an explicit analytic continuation or modified spherical functions.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import { radialFunctionProfile } from '../../../data/part07/usefulRelationsModel.mjs';
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-k-radial]').forEach((root) => {
    const lInput = root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-l]');
    const xMaxInput = root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-xmax]');
    if (!(lInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(xMaxInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
    const jPath = root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-j]');
    const nPath = root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-n]');
    const lOutput = root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-l-output]');
    const xMaxOutput = root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-xmax-output]');
    const readouts = { l: root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-l-readout]'), origin: root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-origin]'), wronskian: root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-wronskian]'), expected: root.querySelector('[data-k-radial-expected]') };
    const left = 62; const right = 700; const top = 42; const bottom = 270; const xMin = 0.65; const displayLimit = 2.5;
    const update = () => {
      const l = Number(lInput.value); const xMax = Number(xMaxInput.value);
      const result = radialFunctionProfile({ l, xMin, xMax, points: 260 });
      const xMap = (x) => left + (right - left) * (x - xMin) / (xMax - xMin);
      const yMap = (value) => (top + bottom) / 2 - Math.max(-displayLimit, Math.min(displayLimit, value)) * (bottom - top) * 0.42 / displayLimit;
      const makePath = (key) => result.samples.map((entry, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xMap(entry.x).toFixed(2)} ${yMap(entry[key]).toFixed(2)}`).join(' ');
      if (jPath instanceof SVGPathElement) jPath.setAttribute('d', makePath('j'));
      if (nPath instanceof SVGPathElement) nPath.setAttribute('d', makePath('n'));
      if (lOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) lOutput.value = String(l);
      if (xMaxOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) xMaxOutput.value = String(xMax);
      if (readouts.l instanceof HTMLElement) readouts.l.textContent = String(l);
      if (readouts.origin instanceof HTMLElement) readouts.origin.textContent = result.samples[0].j.toExponential(4);
      if (readouts.wronskian instanceof HTMLElement) readouts.wronskian.textContent = result.wronskianAtMidpoint.toExponential(5);
      if (readouts.expected instanceof HTMLElement) readouts.expected.textContent = (1 / ((xMin + xMax) / 2) ** 2).toExponential(5);
    };
    [lInput, xMaxInput].forEach((input) => input.addEventListener('input', update)); update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .radial-functions { overflow-x: auto; }
  .radial-functions svg { width: 100%; min-width: 44rem; }
  .radial-functions text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .radial-functions__n { fill: none; stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-2); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 7 4; }
  .radial-functions__n-label { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .radial-functions__controls, .radial-functions__readout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.5rem 1rem; }
  .radial-functions__controls label { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .radial-functions__fallback { max-width: 44rem; }
</style>
